# 🔑 **Comparison Summary**

| Feature             | Option 1: Salesforce                                    | Option 2: Alteryx + Cloud Storage                       |
| ------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------- |
| **Attachments**     | Native (Files/Attachments object)                       | External storage (S3, GDrive, SharePoint) + URL mapping |
| **Additional Info** | Custom fields in SFDC                                   | Added fields in Alteryx workflows                       |
| **Queues**          | Native SFDC Queues                                      | Simulated in workflow (limited)                         |
| **Emails**          | SFDC Workflows (robust)                                 | SMTP-based (basic)                                      |
| **History**         | SFDC records + audit                                    | Database storage + file archive                         |
| **Reporting**       | Tableau → SFDC connector                                | Tableau → Database + File links                         |
| **Cost**            | One-time SFDC config (<\$15K est.)                      | Alteryx licensing + setup (\~higher recurring)          |
| **Scalability**     | Good, but SFDC record/attachment limits                 | Excellent for big data                                  |
| **Best For**        | CRM-centric org, need attachment + workflow integration | Data-heavy org, want flexible ETL + storage separation  |

